WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.556
- You leave the stadium; you
want to see the next game.

00:00:02.556 --> 00:00:03.778
You can't wait for the next game.

00:00:03.778 --> 00:00:05.374
That's what football should be.

00:00:05.374 --> 00:00:08.798
The life is so quick, but
it keeps you in the race.

00:00:08.798 --> 00:00:10.622
It's your experience and experience

00:00:10.622 --> 00:00:12.724
is what you, what you've done in the past.

00:00:12.724 --> 00:00:14.147
Tactical things are so important;

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:16.059
you cannot win without tactical things,

00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:18.760
but, um, the, the, the
emotion make the difference.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:19.893
(loud flipping)

00:00:19.893 --> 00:00:21.293
- He's a former
professional football player

00:00:21.293 --> 00:00:23.886
and is the current manager of Liverpool.

00:00:23.886 --> 00:00:26.199
He spent most of his
15-year playing career

00:00:26.199 --> 00:00:27.925
for one team and then became

00:00:27.925 --> 00:00:29.283
their longest-serving manager.

00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:33.080
He's won the German Football
Manager of the Year twice.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.809
He's Jurgen Klopp, and here's my take

00:00:34.809 --> 00:00:36.198
on his Top 10 Rules to Success.

00:00:36.198 --> 00:00:38.069
Rule number nine is my personal favorite

00:00:38.069 --> 00:00:39.267
and I'd love to know which one

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:40.297
you guys like the best.

00:00:40.297 --> 00:00:41.301
Also, guys, as you're watching,

00:00:41.301 --> 00:00:43.983
if you hear something that
really resonates with you,

00:00:43.983 --> 00:00:45.489
please leave down in the comments below,

00:00:45.489 --> 00:00:46.597
put quotes around it, so other people

00:00:46.597 --> 00:00:48.922
can be inspired by your sharing,

00:00:48.922 --> 00:00:50.236
and also, when you write it down,

00:00:50.236 --> 00:00:51.723
you're much more likely to lock it in

00:00:51.723 --> 00:00:54.264
for yourself, too; enjoy.

00:00:54.264 --> 00:00:55.247
(thunder)

00:00:55.247 --> 00:00:57.040
(bouncing)

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.623
(upbeat music)

00:01:06.829 --> 00:01:10.245
- For sure, we have only this one life

00:01:10.245 --> 00:01:12.859
and we should make the best of it.

00:01:12.859 --> 00:01:14.903
That's what I try to.

00:01:14.903 --> 00:01:16.557
Best, to do the best

00:01:16.557 --> 00:01:20.524
is not to enjoy each
day as, as it, the last.

00:01:20.524 --> 00:01:23.171
Or celebrating, drinking, whatever

00:01:23.171 --> 00:01:25.462
because tomorrow it could be the end.

00:01:25.462 --> 00:01:28.739
No, no, no, it's to, to
make it a better place,

00:01:28.739 --> 00:01:32.043
but I think it's only
possible in your surrounding.

00:01:32.043 --> 00:01:35.986
Come in a room, try that
the people don't feel

00:01:35.986 --> 00:01:37.682
worse when you come in.

00:01:37.682 --> 00:01:39.008
So, that's what I try to do,

00:01:39.008 --> 00:01:41.120
that's how I under, understand life.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:45.033
- How would you describe
your footballing philosophy?

00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:48.370
- Lively (chuckles).
- Mmm.

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:51.351
I think it's, it's not
the smartest way, I know.

00:01:51.351 --> 00:01:53.613
But when it's said, and no, it, I know.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:55.534
- Success is the smartest.
- But at the end that's how

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:57.153
it is; yes, success for, is cool too.

00:01:57.153 --> 00:01:59.082
But first of all, having

00:01:59.082 --> 00:02:01.249
memorable games, in a row,

00:02:02.411 --> 00:02:03.244
that's my first target.

00:02:03.244 --> 00:02:05.455
That the people really
want to see the next game.

00:02:05.455 --> 00:02:08.095
You leave the stadium; you
want to see the next game.

00:02:08.095 --> 00:02:09.710
You can't wait for the next game.

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:11.321
That's what football should be

00:02:11.321 --> 00:02:13.846
and if you can do this very often,

00:02:13.846 --> 00:02:15.593
then you will be successful 100%.

00:02:15.593 --> 00:02:16.841
If you always live in the future

00:02:16.841 --> 00:02:19.239
and, and hope that something
will change in the future,

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:21.068
you forget that you have to change a lot.

00:02:21.068 --> 00:02:22.440
If you always live in the past,

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:25.505
it's a (sighs), maybe for old people,

00:02:25.505 --> 00:02:27.620
hopefully, it's, it's nice, ah,

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:28.986
it's nice to think about

00:02:28.986 --> 00:02:31.133
wonderful moments and things like this,

00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:32.676
but we are not in this, in, in this

00:02:32.676 --> 00:02:34.783
phase in our life, we
are in the, in the middle

00:02:34.783 --> 00:02:36.284
of, of our life and, a,

00:02:36.284 --> 00:02:38.085
a, we have the biggest
influence on everything

00:02:38.085 --> 00:02:41.011
and so we should try to, to, to

00:02:41.011 --> 00:02:43.193
do what we can to, to make it better.

00:02:43.193 --> 00:02:45.680
If not for us, then for our families

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:47.013
or for our friends or whatever,

00:02:47.013 --> 00:02:48.800
and that's, that's what we try with.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:51.279
I think being 100% in the moment

00:02:51.279 --> 00:02:53.544
is the only possibility to
get better in the future.

00:02:53.544 --> 00:02:55.107
We are not on the world to do,

00:02:55.107 --> 00:02:57.986
to do every, do what everybody wants.

00:02:57.986 --> 00:03:00.387
We have to, to be a group.

00:03:00.387 --> 00:03:01.491
Sometime it's only family,

00:03:01.491 --> 00:03:02.898
sometimes it's with friends,

00:03:02.898 --> 00:03:04.701
sometimes it's together, and how I

00:03:04.701 --> 00:03:07.448
understand it, LFC is family and friends.

00:03:07.448 --> 00:03:10.886
Football becomes the game it is today

00:03:10.886 --> 00:03:12.566
because you work together

00:03:12.566 --> 00:03:15.564
and in this moment, we have,
don't only have 11 players,

00:03:15.564 --> 00:03:16.502
who should work together.

00:03:16.502 --> 00:03:18.958
Not only 20 players, not 24 players.

00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:20.521
We have to work together

00:03:20.521 --> 00:03:22.636
here in Melwood, with
all the people working

00:03:22.636 --> 00:03:24.795
and with all the supporters in Liverpool,

00:03:24.795 --> 00:03:26.741
with all the supporters around the world.

00:03:26.741 --> 00:03:29.730
That's what I, what I believe in,

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.212
and if you do this,

00:03:31.212 --> 00:03:32.624
if we are strong in this,

00:03:32.624 --> 00:03:33.960
we will be succeed for sure,

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.510
we will succeed for sure.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:38.432
I had bigger interests
in my life, of course.

00:03:38.432 --> 00:03:40.124
In my own career as a player

00:03:40.124 --> 00:03:43.541
and in my coach career or manager career.

00:03:45.005 --> 00:03:49.967
Yes, it, hard times (chuckles) and mine's

00:03:49.967 --> 00:03:51.280
to stay in Bonus League.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:52.859
I'm mindful of the same challenge

00:03:52.859 --> 00:03:56.284
it's, you, you lose I
think 60% of the games,

00:03:56.284 --> 00:03:58.296
but you have the chance
to stay in the league

00:03:58.296 --> 00:04:00.661
and so you have to learn to handle,

00:04:00.661 --> 00:04:03.678
um, these, these things and

00:04:03.678 --> 00:04:05.360
that's what I learned, of course.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:07.628
Of course it was always hard work here

00:04:07.628 --> 00:04:09.725
and from the first day
on, but of, of course

00:04:09.725 --> 00:04:11.426
it's not the biggest challenge,

00:04:11.426 --> 00:04:14.656
but it's the most strange situation

00:04:14.656 --> 00:04:18.260
because, ah, usually in football you all,

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:21.738
you're responsible for
all faults you make.

00:04:21.738 --> 00:04:24.278
Yes, that's it, that's really

00:04:24.278 --> 00:04:25.564
the true story about football.

00:04:25.564 --> 00:04:27.806
But in our situation
we had so many problems

00:04:27.806 --> 00:04:29.889
with injured players and,

00:04:30.978 --> 00:04:35.690
that, yeah, we had to
work and we had to, to, to

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:39.025
stay confident, to stay self-confident

00:04:39.025 --> 00:04:41.007
for the moment when we are

00:04:41.007 --> 00:04:43.174
ready to, I don't, to run,

00:04:44.496 --> 00:04:46.612
to, to fight in, in our best shape.

00:04:46.612 --> 00:04:48.734
And that's what, what we have,

00:04:48.734 --> 00:04:49.650
but in this time when we have,

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:50.925
when we had to work,

00:04:50.925 --> 00:04:51.787
we had one match,

00:04:51.787 --> 00:04:53.000
we have the next match,

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.411
every three day we had a match, and,

00:04:55.411 --> 00:04:58.157
yes, so, we, when everything
in Chairman's league,

00:04:58.157 --> 00:05:00.123
everything in Cup and

00:05:00.123 --> 00:05:01.933
lost nearly everything
in, in Bonus League.

00:05:01.933 --> 00:05:04.647
It's really strange, it's
really crazy situation,

00:05:04.647 --> 00:05:07.243
but we are, we had to learn

00:05:07.243 --> 00:05:08.501
to handle it because it was,

00:05:08.501 --> 00:05:11.059
it was not the absolute surprise

00:05:11.059 --> 00:05:12.087
that we had problems.

00:05:12.087 --> 00:05:15.353
We need, we knew this
season were we problematic,

00:05:15.353 --> 00:05:19.103
um, but, um, we didn't,
you know, handle this

00:05:21.921 --> 00:05:24.329
in this size the problem,

00:05:24.329 --> 00:05:26.559
so, we had, we had to learn to handle it.

00:05:26.559 --> 00:05:29.003
Now, we are in the, in the situation.

00:05:29.003 --> 00:05:30.451
We know we, what we have to do.

00:05:30.451 --> 00:05:31.940
The players come back,

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:33.380
they get in better shape, and,

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:35.818
and so that's, that's very important,

00:05:35.818 --> 00:05:37.983
but we did only one
step against (mumbles).

00:05:37.983 --> 00:05:40.213
It's the only one, now our next challenge

00:05:40.213 --> 00:05:42.668
Polywon, then Frankfurt, and so on,

00:05:42.668 --> 00:05:44.390
so, no easy game.

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:46.961
Every, is always hard work.

00:05:46.961 --> 00:05:48.432
And so, we try to do it.

00:05:48.432 --> 00:05:49.976
We really work hard that we can be

00:05:49.976 --> 00:05:52.877
as successful as possible immediately.

00:05:52.877 --> 00:05:55.262
But success has, ah, maybe
has a different view for it.

00:05:55.262 --> 00:05:56.922
I would say this season,

00:05:56.922 --> 00:05:58.816
going to Chelsea would
be outstanding success

00:05:58.816 --> 00:06:01.211
with all the quality around, and, so

00:06:01.211 --> 00:06:03.742
there's one team a little bit more lucky,

00:06:03.742 --> 00:06:07.664
big quality, and all that
stuff, no injuries, and

00:06:07.664 --> 00:06:10.027
that's Chelsea and they
did a fantastic job so far

00:06:10.027 --> 00:06:11.139
and if they do it,

00:06:11.139 --> 00:06:13.042
and, and, and can carry on like this,

00:06:13.042 --> 00:06:14.059
and they'll be the champions
and they deserve it.

00:06:14.059 --> 00:06:16.119
And all the rest is fighting for the rest,

00:06:16.119 --> 00:06:18.060
more or less, better or, or worse,

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.330
whatever, in different moments

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:20.420
and there's pressure on all of us.

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:23.422
We will see who will go through.

00:06:23.422 --> 00:06:25.597
But when you get the
target, it's fantastic.

00:06:25.597 --> 00:06:26.430
If you don't get it,

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:28.935
it doesn't mean you, you are,

00:06:28.935 --> 00:06:31.664
you are bad, you are not the right person

00:06:31.664 --> 00:06:32.760
or whatever or does it mean,

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:33.593
come on, try it again?

00:06:33.593 --> 00:06:34.694
That's the thing, when you are convinced

00:06:34.694 --> 00:06:36.802
about a consolation, when
you are convinced about

00:06:36.802 --> 00:06:38.981
a people, (cheering) and in this moment

00:06:38.981 --> 00:06:40.462
you always think about alternatives,

00:06:40.462 --> 00:06:41.513
that's what I do always (cheering).

00:06:41.513 --> 00:06:42.603
So is there somebody else

00:06:42.603 --> 00:06:43.436
who could do it better (cheering)?

00:06:43.436 --> 00:06:44.797
If I would know somebody who could

00:06:44.797 --> 00:06:46.308
do it better, I would not be here.

00:06:46.308 --> 00:06:48.208
Yeah, ask him, so he can do it

00:06:48.208 --> 00:06:49.560
and everything will be good.

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:52.147
So, I'm really, I'm really
convinced about (cheering)

00:06:52.147 --> 00:06:55.341
the, the, the circumstances,
the consolation,

00:06:55.341 --> 00:06:56.839
the basis we have

00:06:56.839 --> 00:06:58.254
and that's what we want to use.

00:06:58.254 --> 00:06:59.136
How long it will take?

00:06:59.136 --> 00:07:00.664
I have no idea,

00:07:00.664 --> 00:07:03.089
but everybody should see that we tried

00:07:03.089 --> 00:07:04.218
really, everyday, really hard.

00:07:04.218 --> 00:07:05.051
(loud flipping)

00:07:05.051 --> 00:07:06.802
I don't live in the past,

00:07:06.802 --> 00:07:08.242
but I like all our, it's, it's

00:07:08.242 --> 00:07:10.747
like with family; father, grandfather,

00:07:10.747 --> 00:07:12.002
things like this, so there's always

00:07:12.002 --> 00:07:13.083
a reason why you are here.

00:07:13.083 --> 00:07:14.798
This is, if you want the grandfather

00:07:14.798 --> 00:07:16.491
and father of, of Liverpool, as seen,

00:07:16.491 --> 00:07:18.162
they are the reason why we are here.

00:07:18.162 --> 00:07:19.921
The life is so quick,

00:07:19.921 --> 00:07:22.369
but it keeps you in the race.

00:07:22.369 --> 00:07:23.592
It's your experience and experience

00:07:23.592 --> 00:07:25.151
is what you, what you've done in the past

00:07:25.151 --> 00:07:26.568
and, and so it's,

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.824
sometimes you can use the
experience of other people

00:07:29.824 --> 00:07:30.958
and that's what we try.

00:07:30.958 --> 00:07:33.248
- How would you personally describe

00:07:33.248 --> 00:07:35.331
your style of leadership?

00:07:37.272 --> 00:07:39.522
- Close to the human being.

00:07:40.584 --> 00:07:43.038
I think discipline is very important,

00:07:43.038 --> 00:07:46.961
very important, but
discipline is relative,

00:07:46.961 --> 00:07:51.640
especially with, when you work
together with young players.

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:54.390
Yeah, never lose the, the target.

00:07:57.482 --> 00:07:58.802
I don't know how to say,

00:07:58.802 --> 00:07:59.727
never lose the target,

00:07:59.727 --> 00:08:01.277
always stay focused on it

00:08:01.277 --> 00:08:02.557
and so that's, that's pretty clear

00:08:02.557 --> 00:08:05.640
because that's, and always, um, yeah,

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:10.197
think it's still possible, so that's the,

00:08:10.197 --> 00:08:11.810
that's not the right words in English.

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:12.643
- Believe.
- But, I would say, yeah,

00:08:12.643 --> 00:08:14.723
for sure believe it's, it's, it's

00:08:14.723 --> 00:08:16.219
a little bit different to belief.

00:08:16.219 --> 00:08:18.199
Belief is, um, you can create,

00:08:18.199 --> 00:08:19.832
you can belief in something,

00:08:19.832 --> 00:08:22.045
but you can lose belief quite easily.

00:08:22.045 --> 00:08:25.003
So to be stronger in a bad
moment, things like this.

00:08:25.003 --> 00:08:29.477
I've watched so many matches
in my life, unbelievable.

00:08:29.477 --> 00:08:31.728
And I really, not so,

00:08:31.728 --> 00:08:33.754
there are some boring games

00:08:33.754 --> 00:08:35.588
and then I, I, I sleep.

00:08:35.588 --> 00:08:37.669
It's so boring I think,

00:08:37.669 --> 00:08:39.475
oh, why they beat each other

00:08:39.475 --> 00:08:43.029
and make this 20, 40, 50, 60, 70, 80,000

00:08:43.029 --> 00:08:43.967
people in the stadium,

00:08:43.967 --> 00:08:46.161
when it's a boring game, it's not okay.

00:08:46.161 --> 00:08:47.822
So that's what we, what we want to see.

00:08:47.822 --> 00:08:50.233
We want to enjoy our, our own game.

00:08:50.233 --> 00:08:52.276
If we lose, okay.

00:08:52.276 --> 00:08:54.030
We like to win, but if we lose

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.620
with our way, it's okay.

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.228
If we lose with the way of somebody else,

00:08:57.228 --> 00:09:00.461
it's, it's, you, you
cannot work with this.

00:09:00.461 --> 00:09:03.378
So, that's it, it's very emotional,

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:06.567
very fast, very strong,

00:09:07.621 --> 00:09:10.288
not boring, no chess, like this.

00:09:11.144 --> 00:09:13.510
- No tactical.
- No, yes, of course tactical.

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:16.677
Yes, but tactical with, with big heart

00:09:18.155 --> 00:09:20.528
and tactical things are so important.

00:09:20.528 --> 00:09:22.060
You cannot win without tactical things,

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:25.722
but, um, the, the, the
emotion make the difference.

00:09:25.722 --> 00:09:28.507
Life in our, in our game that's important.

00:09:28.507 --> 00:09:30.025
- You're emotional; on
the side of the pitch

00:09:30.025 --> 00:09:31.284
I watch you, you're, you know.

00:09:31.284 --> 00:09:33.017
- Yeah, but if it's a sizable game,

00:09:33.017 --> 00:09:34.930
yeah, that's only one
part of me, to be honest.

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:36.635
It's most of the time I'm, I'm,

00:09:36.635 --> 00:09:38.785
I'm not that emotional, thank God.

00:09:38.785 --> 00:09:40.971
So, but, during the game,

00:09:40.971 --> 00:09:42.043
something happened to me I don't know.

00:09:42.043 --> 00:09:44.196
I, I, until to now, 49, I cannot exactly

00:09:44.196 --> 00:09:45.658
explain what it is.

00:09:45.658 --> 00:09:47.800
But, if I would see another person

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:49.203
doing what I do,

00:09:49.203 --> 00:09:51.184
I will think, is he crazy?

00:09:51.184 --> 00:09:53.601
(loud crowd)

00:09:58.912 --> 00:10:00.652
- Look now it's not just the Cup anymore.

00:10:00.652 --> 00:10:02.504
It's the whole ground forces of him.

00:10:02.504 --> 00:10:03.337
- Yeah.
- You know, unlike (mumbles)

00:10:03.337 --> 00:10:05.975
he want us to stand up
and everyone (mumbles)

00:10:05.975 --> 00:10:08.274
he's looking at clock now
and watching the football

00:10:08.274 --> 00:10:11.330
because he's peeking and wait
see what he's going to do next.

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:13.278
But he's fantastic, you know.

00:10:13.278 --> 00:10:15.238
(thunder)

00:10:15.238 --> 00:10:17.342
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:10:17.342 --> 00:10:18.433
I made this video because

00:10:18.433 --> 00:10:20.350
Fernando Taveres asked me to,

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:21.392
